  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education2Action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education2Action is creating a network of entrepreneurial Israeli and Palestinian youth peacemakers to address challenges in and between their communities. This activity selects high school participants through a rigorous recruitment process for specialized training in computer science, entrepreneurship, and leadership. More than 1,000 youth will take part in this two-year educational program in partnership with the Massachusetts Institute of Technology, followed by a two-year entrepreneurial and volunteer practicum.</narrative>
  </description>
